'''RS-89 Shadow Paragon''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the [[body armor]] and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page 1 of the [[Redacted Regiment Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|45|notext}} and 30 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

